(S5, L5 % 8 + "Which letter comes next in the following series? B, D, J, L, R, ?", ["S", "V", "T", "U"], 2, "The steps alternate +2 and +6: B to D (+2), D to J (+6), J to L (+2), L to R (+6), so R + 2 = T.", LET),
