(S5, L5 % 15 + "If one shirt can be made with 2 1/3 metres of cloth, how many shirts can be made from 14 metres of cloth?", ["5", "7", "8", "6"], 3, "2 1/3 is 7/3. Then 14 divided by 7/3 is 14 x 3/7 = 6.", "Tip: convert mixed fractions to improper fractions before dividing."),
